  "question": {
    "text": "A cylindrical vessel of cross-section A contains water to a height $\\mathrm{h}$. There is a hole in the bottom of radius ' $a$ '. The time in which it will be emptied is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "bd5tx",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{2 \\mathrm{~A}}{\\pi \\mathrm{a}^2} \\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{\\mathrm{g}}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x0g9j",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{~A}}{\\pi \\mathrm{a}^2} \\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{\\mathrm{g}}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "iQb9L",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{2 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{~A}}{\\pi \\mathrm{a}^2} \\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{\\mathrm{g}}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qEgJW",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\mathrm{A}}{\\sqrt{2} \\pi \\mathrm{a}^2} \\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{\\mathrm{g}}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\text { Let the rate of falling water level be }-\\frac{d h}{d t}\n$$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/slu-xQFM6L0BkrR0Kq2COyH9gyrJ7xks2DxIwxeWjp8.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nInitially at $t=0 ; h=h$\n$$\nt=t ; h=0\n$$\nThen, $A\\left(-\\frac{d h}{d t}\\right)=\\pi a^2 \\cdot v$\n$$\nd t=-\\frac{A}{\\pi a^2 \\sqrt{2 g h}} d h\n$$\n$[\\because$ velocity of efflux of liquid $v=\\sqrt{2 g h}]$ Integrating both sides\n$$\n\\int_0^t d t=-\\frac{A}{\\sqrt{2 g} \\pi a^2} \\int_h^0 h^{-1 / 2} d h\n$$\n$$\n[t]_0^t=-\\frac{A}{\\sqrt{2 g} \\pi a^2} \\cdot\\left[\\frac{h^{1 / 2}}{1 / 2}\\right]_h^0\n$$\n\n$$\nt=\\frac{\\sqrt{2} A}{\\pi a^2} \\sqrt{\\frac{h}{g}}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
